  m_text: "<color=#FFA726><b>\"Infected display hyper-kinesis, sensory frenzy, and loss of pain response due to rapid frontal necrosis.\"</b></color>\n<color=#45B7FF><b>\u2022 COMBAT DIRECTIVE:</b></color> <color=#CFD8DC>Cranial destruction is sole neutralization vector. Prioritize retreat.</color>\n<color=#45B7FF><b>\u2022 HYDRATION SAFETY:</b></color> <color=#CFD8DC>Boil tap water min. 10 minutes. Dehydration accelerates susceptibility.</color>"
